4:## PAGE [wedding]: https://www.albertriverwines.com.au/
5-
10:Albert River Wines is a versatile venue that caters to Weddings, Functions, Farm Tours, Dining at Auchenflower Restaurant and our Cellar Door
11-
13:Albert River Wines sweeping grounds are home to two historical buildings and sprawling vineyards. Auchenflower House has been home to three former Queensland Premiers, was relocated from Auchenflower in Brisbane and is where our restaurant and cellar door is located. The buildings wrap around deck, allows for alfresco dining with a view of Tamborine Mountain and our vineyards. Enjoying delicious food and spectacular wine has never been easier. Attached is Auchenflower Ballroom, our largest Wedding and Functions space, with the capacity to host 150 guests.
