395-## Our Inspiration
397:At Albert River Wines, we are passionate about producing premium wines that are uniquely Queensland. Our estate-grown fruit, harvested from our Tamborine vineyards, and quality contract-grown Queensland grapes are blended to create brilliant wines that suit our climate and the preferred tastes of our state. Our commitment to quality has been recognized with numerous awards, including several gold medals at prestigious shows across Australia and the world. We are proud to be a part of the new generation of Queensland wine producers, offering great quality wine at a price that suits all of our customers.
