400:## PAGE [other]: https://www.albertriverwines.com.au/functions
401-
406:Whether it’s a milestone birthday, Christmas party, end of year celebration, celebration of life, charity gala, formals, engagement party and more....... Our dedicated team can tailor your special event.
407-
408:Our event spaces include Auchenflower Ballroom, Tamborine House and The Vineyard Deck (evenings only in Jan, Feb, March, November and December), with the capacity to cater for up to 200 guests cocktail-function or 150 guests seated. There is a space suitable for any special occasion at Albert River Wines.
409-
410:For your private event, select from cocktail, buffet, alternate drop or set menus. Our chefs event menus are designed to suit a celebration and to utilise local produce.
