421-
422:The friendly staff at Albert River Wines would like to welcome all Senior Tour Groups to join us for a tour of our historic colonial farm.
423-
425:Enjoy a stroll through our historic 1800’s homesteads, Tamborine House, the fully restored Auchenflower House, and Taabinga Chapel – the original Taabinga Lutheran Chapel.
426-
431:With comfortable seating at Auchenflower Restaurant, wheelchair access and ample parking for buses, this venue is ideal for tour groups to enjoy an outing in the Australian country.
432-
433:Tours run at 11am Wednesday to Friday, bookings are essential (5543 6622)
